      tldr: 'A pool cleaning visit in Dallas runs around $30, with a range of $27–$32 a visit (HomeBlue\u2019s Dallas page). Four visits a month come to $109–$128 on that same page. A weekly plan from a Dallas operator costs more — from $149 a month for partial and $209 for full service from Blue Science, and $250 a month flat from Golden Hour Pools. Budget $1,600–$1,900 a year for annual maintenance (HomeBlue).',
