      tldr: 'A house wash in Dallas runs $165–$375, averaging about $270 (Angi’s Dallas page). In Fort Worth, HomeBlue puts a 1,500 to 2,000 square foot house at $400–$600, around $500, and in Irving at $300–$600, around $400. A driveway is $100–$250 in Dallas (Angi), $150–$260 in Fort Worth and $130–$230 in Irving (HomeBlue). Per square foot, Thumbtack’s Dallas page puts pressure washing at about $0.10–$0.17 per square foot of your property size.',
