      body: '{{img:0}}<h3>What Dallas–Fort Worth drivers actually pay</h3><p>Published prices from Dallas and Fort Worth mobile detailers:</p><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Typical price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Express detail, Dallas (Panda Hub)</td><td>From $79.91</td></tr><tr><td>Deluxe Wash, Fort Worth (My Detail Guys)</td><td>$99–$119 by vehicle</td></tr><tr><td>Exterior / interior detail (Dallas Best)</td><td>From $125 / from $150</td></tr><tr><td>Basic detail, Dallas (SHWASH)</td><td>$168–$190</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail (Dallas Best / Panda Hub “Revive”)</td><td>From $225 / from $227.10</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, standard, Dallas (SHWASH)</td><td>$269–$290</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, mobile, by vehicle (My Detail Guys)</td><td>$279 car / $309 truck or SUV / $329 large</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, by vehicle (Gilded Auto Spa, DFW)</td><td>$300 car / $375 SUV or truck / $450 3-row</td></tr><tr><td>Supreme / premium detail (My Detail Guys / SHWASH)</td><td>$379–$429 by vehicle / $468–$490</td></tr><tr><td>Ceramic coating (Dallas Best)</td><td>From $899</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, national (Jobber, national)</td><td>$200–$300 or more — $150–$250 sedan, $200–$500 truck</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This is where people overpay. A “$99 full detail” ad in Dallas is usually a fast wash and a quick vacuum, as My Detail Guys puts it in its own guide. A real full detail takes 2.5 to 3.5 hours at your home.</p>{{img:1}}<h3>What changes the price in Dallas–Fort Worth?</h3><p><strong>Vehicle size, first.</strong> DFW runs on trucks and big SUVs, and every list prices that in. My Detail Guys charges $279 for a car and $329 for a large SUV, van or truck for the same full detail. Gilded charges $300 for a car and $450 for a three-row. More seats, more carpet, more paint. Simple math.</p><p><strong>Texas heat and sun.</strong> Panda Hub\'s Dallas page is blunt about leather: cabin heat can crack it in a single summer here, so conditioning is part of a Dallas full detail, not a nice extra. The same page ties paint damage to construction grit on I-35 and I-635 commutes — fine debris working into the clear coat on a car parked outside in Lower Greenville (75206) or Frisco (75034).</p><p><strong>Pet hair, stains and sand.</strong> My Detail Guys names pet hair as a top price driver in Dallas, and sand in carpets as a common Texas problem. On its Fort Worth list, heavy pet hair and spill removal starts at $50 extra, a clay bar is $75 and headlight work is $99. Name the mess before you book and the quote holds.</p><p><strong>Water and power at your spot.</strong> Dallas Best, My Detail Guys and Panda Hub all say they bring their own. That matters in DFW — an apartment lot in Lower Greenville or an office garage in Frisco may have no hookup at all.</p><h3>How to pay less without a worse detail</h3><ul class="check-list"><li><strong>Keep up a cheaper wash between full details.</strong> A $79.91 express in Dallas or a $99 Deluxe Wash in Fort Worth holds a car that already had a full detail. It does not replace one.</li><li><strong>Send photos for the quote.</strong> My Detail Guys asks for daylight photos of the seats, carpets, trunk and wheels. A photo quote is a firm quote. A guess is not.</li><li><strong>Skip the top package on a car you are selling soon.</strong> The jump from $279 to $379 buys iron removal and a longer sealant. Worth it on a car you keep. Hard to get back on a trade-in.</li><li><strong>Book the interior only if the paint is fine.</strong> Interior work in Dallas mostly lands at $150–$220 for a mid-size car. No need to pay full-detail money for a cabin problem.</li></ul><h3>A Dallas–Fort Worth mobile detailing business listed on Van Squads</h3><p><strong>Frisco Mobile Detailing</strong> is listed on Van Squads, offering mobile auto detailing at your location in ZIP 75034 in Frisco. See its listing and request a quote: <a href="/business/frisco-mobile-detailing">Frisco Mobile Detailing on Van Squads</a>.</p><p>Van Squads lists 15 mobile auto detailing businesses in the metro — five in Lower Greenville, Dallas ZIP 75206, four in Frisco ZIP 75034, and six in Keller ZIP 76244: <a href="/#/browse?zip=75034">search mobile detailing near 75034</a>.</p><p>Want the whole list on one page? <a href=\"/mobile-auto-detailing/dallas-fort-worth/\">Mobile auto detailing in Dallas–Fort Worth</a> has every company Van Squads lists there, with phone numbers and service areas.</p><p>In Dallas? Try: <a href="/#/browse?zip=75206">search mobile detailing near 75206</a>.</p><p>On the Fort Worth side? Try: <a href="/#/browse?zip=76244">search mobile detailing near 76244</a>.</p>{{img:2}}'
