      body: '{{img:0}}<h3>What Boise homeowners actually pay</h3><p>Prices from Boise and Treasure Valley sources:</p><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Typical Boise price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cleaner by the hour, Boise (Care.com, Oct 2026)</td><td>$20.38/hr starting, up to $25.41/hr</td></tr><tr><td>Cleaner by the hour, Boise companies (MaidProfit)</td><td>$26–$42 per cleaner</td></tr><tr><td>Standard clean, Boise home</td><td>$120–$250 per visit</td></tr><tr><td>Recurring, 1,200–1,499 sq ft (Wanny Clean)</td><td>$95 weekly / $125 every 2 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Recurring, 2,400–2,699 sq ft (Wanny Clean)</td><td>$175 weekly / $235 every 2 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Recurring, 3,900–4,199 sq ft (Wanny Clean)</td><td>$275 weekly / $365 every 2 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Recurring, by bedrooms (Lone Star, Treasure Valley)</td><td>$120–$180 for 1–2 bed / $180–$280 for 3–4 bed / $280+ for 5+ bed</td></tr><tr><td>Deep cleaning, by bedrooms (Lone Star)</td><td>$180–$260 for 1–2 bed / $280–$420 for 3–4 bed / $400+ for 5+ bed</td></tr><tr><td>Deep cleaning, Idaho (MaidProfit, Idaho-wide)</td><td>$230–$450</td></tr><tr><td>Move-in / move-out cleaning</td><td>From $200 (Lone Star) / $260–$490 in Idaho (MaidProfit)</td></tr><tr><td>House cleaning, national (HomeGuide, national)</td><td>$25–$75/hr per cleaner, $120–$280 a visit on average</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The hourly gap trips people up. Care.com\'s $20.38 is a starting rate for cleaners listed there. Company crews run $26 to $42 an hour per cleaner (MaidProfit). Not the same thing — do not expect a company quote to match the lower number.</p><p>This is where people overpay: paying a deep-clean price for a home that needs a standard visit, or booking one-time cleans over and over. Recurring service is 10 to 15% cheaper per visit than one-time cleans (Lone Star).</p>{{img:1}}<h3>What changes the price in Boise?</h3><p><strong>Home size and bathrooms.</strong> Every Boise list prices this first. Wanny Clean goes from $95 a week for 1,200 sq ft to $375 a week at 5,400 sq ft. Bathrooms add detail work on top.</p><p><strong>Which Boise home you have.</strong> Older houses in the North End (83703) and East End have original woodwork, deep ledges and wood floors that need a careful hand. Newer homes in Harris Ranch (83716) and Southeast Boise (83706) mean open kitchens, several bathrooms and big windows. Ranch homes on the Bench (83705) and in West Boise (83704, 83713) bring carpet, tile and yard traffic. Same city, different jobs.</p><p><strong>First clean vs. recurring.</strong> Most Boise cleaners want a deep clean first. Wanny Clean prices its Welcome Clean separately, after it learns the home\'s size, condition and pets. After that, weekly is the lowest price per visit — less builds up.</p><p><strong>Pets and mudrooms.</strong> Pet hair adds time, and mudrooms and garages track in dirt all winter. Name both before you book and the quote holds.</p><p><strong>Where you sit in the Treasure Valley.</strong> Care.com puts Meridian at $22.74 an hour starting, above Boise\'s $20.38, with Eagle at $21.45 and Nampa at $20.08. A Meridian (83642, 83646) quote a bit above a Boise one is normal, not a markup.</p><h3>How to pay less without getting a worse clean</h3><ul class="check-list"><li><strong>Go every other week if weekly feels like too much.</strong> A 2,400 sq ft home is $235 every other week (Wanny Clean). Lone Star calls bi-weekly the most popular Treasure Valley choice too.</li><li><strong>Start recurring after the deep clean, not instead of it.</strong> The deep clean does baseboards, cabinet fronts and buildup once. Paying standard money and hoping for deep-clean work leaves both sides annoyed.</li><li><strong>Get a flat price in writing.</strong> Square footage, bedrooms and bathrooms are enough to quote flat. An open hourly quote on a big Harris Ranch home can drift.</li><li><strong>Skip add-ons you do not need.</strong> Inside the oven, inside the fridge and wall washing are priced separately in Boise. Add one when it needs doing.</li></ul><h3>A Boise house cleaning business listed on Van Squads</h3><p><strong>Scrub \'N Bubbles Home Cleaning, LLC</strong> is listed on Van Squads, offering house cleaning at your location across Boise in ZIPs 83709, 83702, 83703, 83704, 83705, 83706, 83712, 83713, 83714 and 83716 — Southwest Boise, Downtown, the North End, West Boise, the Bench, Southeast Boise, East Boise and Harris Ranch. See its listing: <a href="/business/scrub-n-bubbles-home-cleaning-llc">Scrub \'N Bubbles Home Cleaning, LLC on Van Squads</a>.</p><p>Van Squads lists 21 house cleaning businesses in the Boise metro — nine in Southwest Boise ZIP 83709, six in Nampa ZIP 83651, six in Meridian ZIP 83642: <a href="/#/browse?zip=83709">search house cleaning near 83709</a>.</p><p>Want the whole list on one page? <a href=\"/house-cleaning/boise/\">House cleaning in Boise</a> has every company Van Squads lists there, with phone numbers and service areas.</p><p>In Meridian? Try: <a href="/#/browse?zip=83642">search house cleaning near 83642</a>.</p><p>In Nampa? Try: <a href="/#/browse?zip=83651">search house cleaning near 83651</a>.</p>{{img:2}}'
