      tldr: 'In Boise, a handyman runs $40–$80 an hour, plus materials. A half-day list runs $170–$330, and a full day runs $350–$650 (HomeBlue, Boise). One fall job has its own flat price here: a sprinkler blowout runs $65–$85 for 1–5 zones, and it costs more the later you book it.',
