      tldr: 'In Boise, a deep cleaning runs $180–$260 for a 1–2 bedroom home and $280–$420 for 3–4 bedrooms (Lone Star, Treasure Valley). A standard 2,000 sq ft home generally falls between $400 and $550 for a one-time deep clean (Favorite Day Maid). Idaho-wide, deep cleans run $230–$450 (MaidProfit). Listed individuals in Boise start at $20.38 an hour on Care.com, but company crews charge more.',
