      tldr: 'In Omaha, a full mobile detail runs $275 for a sedan and $339–$399 for an SUV or truck on Flawless Mobile Car Detailing\'s list, and $325–$550 for an inside-and-out package at Invictus. Exterior-only starts at $99, interior-only at $170. The car never leaves your driveway.',
