      tldr: 'In Omaha, house washing runs $225 for a house up to 2,500 sq ft at Window Genie of Omaha, and flat surface cleaning is the same $225 up to 2,500 sq ft. Roof washing is $299 up to 3,000 sq ft. Two other Omaha sources put a house wash higher — $250–$500 (Brush & Roll) and $250–$600 (No Pressure Power Washing) — so the $225 price is a capped starting price, not the whole market.',
