      tldr: 'In Sioux Falls, a mobile wash and detail starts at $99 at Freedom Mobile Detailing, and its complete details start at $275. Interior-only work starts at $199 there. Precision Auto Detailing, a Sioux Falls shop list, starts full details higher — $330 for a car to $400 for a large SUV. Every local list prices by size and condition — the starting number is rarely final.',
      faq: [
        { q: 'How much does mobile car detailing cost in Sioux Falls?', a: 'A mobile wash and detail starts at $99 at Freedom Mobile Detailing, and its complete details start at $275. Precision Auto Detailing, a Sioux Falls shop list, starts full details at $330 for a car and $400 for a large SUV. Nationally, mobile detailing averages $144–$254 (Thumbtack, national).' }, { q: 'How much does interior-only detailing cost in Sioux Falls?', a: 'Freedom\'s interior details start at $199 (Level 1) and run to $329 (Level 3). Precision starts at $300 for a car, $320 for a pickup, and $340 for a large SUV.' }, { q: 'Why did my quote go up after the detailer saw the car?', a: 'Because Sioux Falls lists price by size and condition. Precision sets the final price after a pre-inspection and can add fees for pet hair, stains, mud, and bugs. Freedom\'s prices are all \"starting at.\" Photos sent ahead let the detailer price the actual mess, not the average one.' }, { q: 'What does a full detail include in Sioux Falls?', a: 'On Precision\'s list: full interior reconditioning, a hand wash, the engine compartment, wheels and wheel wells, tar removal, tire dressing, a one-step polish, and a 3–6 month wax. Freedom\'s complete details cover interior and exterior work at three levels, starting at $275, $449, and $799.' }, { q: 'How do I find mobile car detailing near me in Sioux Falls?', a: 'Search Van Squads by ZIP. Coverage runs across Sioux Falls ZIPs 57103, 57104, 57105, 57106, 57107, 57108 and 57110 — 8 listed businesses, some also covering Brandon, Tea, and Harrisburg.' }
      ],
      body: '{{img:0}}<h3>What Sioux Falls drivers actually pay</h3><p>Published Sioux Falls prices — Freedom is mobile; Precision is a shop list; national figures are labeled national:</p><table class=\"price-table\"><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Typical price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mobile wash and detail, starting (Freedom, Sioux Falls)</td><td>$99</td></tr><tr><td>Complete detail, Platinum, starting (Freedom)</td><td>$275</td></tr><tr><td>Interior detail, Level 1 / Level 3, starting (Freedom)</td><td>$199 / $329</td></tr><tr><td>Headlight restoration (Freedom)</td><td>$89</td></tr><tr><td>Buff and polish paint enhancement, starting (Freedom)</td><td>$199</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, starting — car / small SUV / pickup / large SUV (Precision, Sioux Falls)</td><td>$330 / $340 / $375 / $400</td></tr><tr><td>Interior detail, starting — car / pickup / large SUV (Precision)</td><td>$300 / $320 / $340</td></tr><tr><td>Hand wash and wax (Precision)</td><td>$120</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detailing, national average (Thumbtack, national)</td><td>$144–$254</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This is where people overpay. The gap between the $99 wash and the $275 complete detail is not soap — it is interior time. If the cabin is the mess, pay for the cabin. If the outside is the problem, a $120 wash and wax beats a $330 full detail you did not need.</p>{{img:1}}<h3>What changes the price in Sioux Falls?</h3><p><strong>Size first, condition second.</strong> Precision starts a full detail at $330 for a car and $400 for a large SUV, before it even looks at the state of the thing. Its final price is set after a pre-inspection, and extra fees can apply for pet hair, stains, mud, and bugs. Freedom lists everything as \"starting at\" for the same reason. A garage-kept sedan and a work truck that hauls gravel out past Tea are not the same job.</p><p><strong>Winter is the local bill.</strong> Sioux Falls is heading into salt and slush season. Salt sits on lower panels and eats into mats and carpet all winter. A $120 wash and wax now costs less than correction work in March. One Sioux Falls detailer, HD Detailing, puts it plainly in a customer quote on its site: after a long winter in South Dakota, the car needed cleaning inside and out.</p><p><strong>Mobile or shop changes what you are buying.</strong> Freedom comes to your driveway or office in Sioux Falls, Tea, or Brandon, and its wash starts at $99. Precision\'s full detail runs $330–$400 because it includes a one-step polish and a 3–6 month wax. Two different jobs, not two prices for one job.</p><p><strong>Add-ons are where a $275 detail becomes a $400 one.</strong> Headlight restoration is $89 at Freedom and trim restoration is $49. Precision charges $75 for an engine bay and $50 for harsh odor removal, which may still need a full interior detail on top. Price all of it before the work starts, not after.</p><h3>How to pay less without a worse detail</h3><ul class=\"check-list\"><li><strong>Buy the half that is dirty.</strong> Interior-only starts at $199 at Freedom. Exterior-only starts at $180 at Precision, and a wash and wax is $120. A full detail is the wrong buy when only one side needs work.</li><li><strong>Send photos before you book.</strong> Every list here prices by condition. Photos of the seats, mats, and worst panel get you a real number instead of a starting number.</li><li><strong>Ask who brings water and power.</strong> Some mobile detailers run self-contained units, others need your hose and outlet. In an apartment lot or an office garage, that decides who can take the job at all.</li></ul><h3>A Sioux Falls mobile detailing business listed on Van Squads</h3><p><strong>Koster Mobile Detail</strong> is listed on Van Squads, offering mobile auto detailing at your location across Sioux Falls ZIPs 57103, 57104, 57105, 57106, 57107, 57108 and 57110, plus Brandon (57005) and Tea (57064). See its listing: <a href=\"/business/koster-mobile-detail\">Koster Mobile Detail on Van Squads</a>.</p><p>Van Squads lists 8 mobile auto detailing businesses in the Sioux Falls metro: <a href=\"/#/browse?zip=57106\">search mobile auto detailing near 57106</a>.</p><p>Want the whole list on one page? <a href=\"/mobile-auto-detailing/sioux-falls/\">Mobile auto detailing in Sioux Falls</a> has every company Van Squads lists there, with phone numbers and service areas.</p><p>House needs work too? See the Sioux Falls house cleaning cost guide: <a href=\"/blog/how-much-does-house-cleaning-cost-in-sioux-falls/\">How much does house cleaning cost in Sioux Falls?</a></p><p>Comparing metros? See the Omaha mobile car detailing cost guide: <a href=\"/blog/how-much-does-mobile-car-detailing-cost-in-omaha/\">How much does mobile car detailing cost in Omaha?</a></p>{{img:2}}'
