      tldr: 'In Portland, pressure washing a house runs about $600 on average on HomeBlue\'s Portland guide — $400–$800 for a 1,500 to 2,000 sq ft house. Angi\'s Portland page puts it lower, at $433 on average ($265–$601). A driveway averages about $240 on HomeBlue, $170–$300 for a standard 40 x 20 ft driveway. Portland runs about 40% above the national average (Angi). Oregon has no sales tax, so the quote is the price you pay.',
