      tldr: 'In Salt Lake City, a standard house cleaning runs $135 to $275 on MaidProfit\'s city row, at $28 to $46 an hour per cleaner. Care.com puts an individual Salt Lake cleaner at about $21.28 an hour — solo cleaners, not companies. Local companies price by the visit: Queen of Maids starts recurring plans at $149 every two weeks, and Wasatch Cleaners starts a one-time standard clean at $219 for a small home, $289 for a 3-bedroom.',
