      excerpt: 'Pressure washing in Salt Lake City runs about $500 for a house wash on HomeBlue, with driveways at $150–$270 and a typical Sandy property at $200–$500 — local prices, what drives quotes in the metro, and how to pay less.',
      metaDescription: 'Pressure washing in Salt Lake City: house wash about $500 on HomeBlue, driveways $150–$270. Winter salt, soft washing, ways to pay less.',
