      excerpt: 'House cleaning in Tulsa runs $95–$210 for a standard clean, with every-other-week plans at $99–$139 by room count and a 3-bedroom home from $158 a visit weekly — local prices, what drives quotes in the metro, and how to pay less.',
      metaDescription: 'House cleaning in Tulsa: standard cleans $95–$210, every-other-week plans $99–$139, deep cleans from $350. Local prices, ways to save.',
