      tldr: 'In Tulsa, pressure washing a house averages about $500 on HomeBlue — $400 to $600 for a 1,500 to 2,000 sq ft house. A standard 40 x 20 ft driveway averages about $200, at $150 to $260, and a Tulsa operator puts a two-car driveway at $200 and a three-car at $250. Red clay is the local catch: it bonds to concrete, so a stained driveway in Tulsa (74105) can need a pre-treatment or a second pass.',
