      body: '{{img:0}}<h3>What Tulsa drivers actually pay</h3><p>Prices from Tulsa mobile operators, plus national rows labeled national:</p><table class="price-table"><thead><tr><th>Job</th><th>Typical price</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Express exterior wash, sedan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$75</td></tr><tr><td>Express exterior wash, truck / SUV (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$80</td></tr><tr><td>Express exterior wash, XL SUV / minivan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$99</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detail, coupe (GT Auto Detailing Co.)</td><td>$105</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detail, sedan (GT Auto Detailing Co.)</td><td>$125</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detail, 3rd row (GT Auto Detailing Co.)</td><td>$150</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detail, full-size pickup (GT Auto Detailing Co.)</td><td>$175</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, car / sedan (Top Tier Detailing)</td><td>$150</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, midsize SUV / crossover (Top Tier Detailing)</td><td>$175</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, truck / large SUV / van (Top Tier Detailing)</td><td>$200</td></tr><tr><td>Full detail, flat rate (G Car Details)</td><td>$170</td></tr><tr><td>Interior only (G Car Details)</td><td>$150</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile visit charge on top of drop-off price (G Car Details)</td><td>+$20</td></tr><tr><td>Express interior, sedan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$185</td></tr><tr><td>Express full detail, sedan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$199</td></tr><tr><td>Express full detail, truck / SUV (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$239</td></tr><tr><td>Express full detail, XL SUV / minivan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$275</td></tr><tr><td>Executive full detail, sedan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$315</td></tr><tr><td>Executive full detail, XL SUV / minivan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$399</td></tr><tr><td>3-year ceramic coating, sedan (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$799</td></tr><tr><td>3-year ceramic coating, full-size truck / XL SUV (Tulsa Mobile Detailing Co.)</td><td>$999</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detailing, per service, national (Housecall Pro, national)</td><td>$109–$250</td></tr><tr><td>Mobile detailing, average range, national (Thumbtack, national)</td><td>$144–$254</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This is where people overpay. Booking the interior and exterior as two separate visits costs more than one full detail. Tulsa Mobile Detailing Company says its full detail saves $30 or more, and its own list backs that up: $185 for the interior plus $75 for the exterior is $260, against $199 for the full detail on the same sedan.</p>{{img:1}}<h3>What changes the price in Tulsa?</h3><p><strong>Size is the first line on every list.</strong> The same full detail is $150 for a car and $200 for a truck or large SUV at Top Tier, and $199 for a sedan against $275 for a third-row vehicle at Tulsa Mobile Detailing Company. A third row is more carpet, glass, and seats to shampoo. Quote it as one — a price given for a sedan won\'t hold for a three-row.</p><p><strong>The Highway 169 commute is its own kind of dirty.</strong> Tulsa Mobile Detailing Company\'s Owasso page sells its express exterior as a way to "wash off the Highway 169 commute" — highway miles lay a film of road grit and bug spots across the front of the car that a tunnel wash leaves behind. If your car lives on 169, the exterior is usually the half that needs the work.</p><p><strong>Condition beats package names.</strong> G Car Details prices its $170 full detail for cars "up to about 60% dirty" — past that, expect the quote to move. Pet hair, ground-in snacks in a third row, and red dust in the footwells all take time, and time is the price. Send photos before you book and the number you hear is the number you pay.</p><p><strong>Mobile is sometimes a line item, sometimes built in.</strong> G Car Details charges $20 more to come to you instead of taking a drop-off. Mobile-only operators bake the trip into the package price. Either way, ask whether the detailer brings their own water and power — Tulsa Mobile Detailing Company does, which matters in an apartment lot or office garage in Midtown with no hose hookup nearby.</p><h3>How long does a mobile detail take in Tulsa?</h3><p>Top Tier Detailing puts a full detail at about 2 to 4 hours, at your home or office. That\'s the real product here — the car gets cleaned in the driveway in ZIP 74114 while you get on with your day. Book the longer end if the car hasn\'t been detailed in a year; a first detail after a long gap is slower than the same package on a kept-up car.</p><h3>How to pay less and still get a real detail</h3><ul class="check-list"><li><strong>Buy the full detail, not the two halves.</strong> On the Tulsa lists above, one combined visit runs $30 to $60 less than the interior and exterior booked apart.</li><li><strong>Detail the half that\'s dirty.</strong> If the paint still looks fine, an interior-only visit at $150 to $185 fixes the part you sit in every day. If the inside is clean, a $75 express exterior is the whole job.</li><li><strong>Name the extras up front.</strong> Pet hair, a child seat, a stained third row — say it on the phone. Surprises found on the driveway are priced on the driveway.</li><li><strong>Keep it up instead of rescuing it.</strong> A car detailed twice a year stays in the cheaper "up to about 60% dirty" band. One detailed every three years pays rescue prices every time.</li></ul><h3>A Tulsa mobile detailing business listed on Van Squads</h3><p><strong>AutoShine Mobile Car Detailing Tulsa</strong> is listed on Van Squads, offering mobile auto detailing at your location in Tulsa (74114) — the Midtown ZIP that covers the Cherry Street and Maple Ridge area. See its listing: <a href="/business/autoshine-mobile-car-detailing-tulsa">AutoShine Mobile Car Detailing Tulsa on Van Squads</a>.</p><p>Van Squads lists 6 mobile auto detailing businesses in the Tulsa metro, all covering Tulsa ZIP 74114: <a href="/#/browse?zip=74114">search mobile detailing near 74114</a>.</p><p>Want the whole list on one page? <a href="/mobile-auto-detailing/tulsa/">Mobile auto detailing in Tulsa</a> has every company Van Squads lists there, with phone numbers and service areas.</p><p>House due for a clean too? See the Tulsa house cleaning cost guide: <a href="/blog/how-much-does-house-cleaning-cost-in-tulsa/">How much does house cleaning cost in Tulsa?</a></p><p>Driveway due too? See the Tulsa pressure washing cost guide: <a href="/blog/how-much-does-pressure-washing-cost-in-tulsa/">How much does pressure washing cost in Tulsa?</a></p><p>Comparing metros? See the Denver mobile car detailing cost guide: <a href="/blog/how-much-does-mobile-car-detailing-cost-in-denver/">How much does mobile car detailing cost in Denver?</a></p>{{img:2}}'
